sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Kiosk as QR Kiosk / QR Console
    participant Phone as Check-in form
    participant API as NestJS CheckinController
    participant Svc as CheckinService
    participant Redis
    participant Queue as QueueEngine
    participant Gate as GateService
    participant Sock as KioskGateway

    Kiosk->>Sock: kiosk.join gateId
    Sock->>Svc: getDisplay
    Svc->>Redis: GET checkin:gate:gateId
    Svc-->>Sock: CheckinDisplay
    Sock-->>Kiosk: checkin.display

    Note over Svc,Sock: After LPR or SAP mint
    Svc->>Redis: SET ticket + gate key EX 180
    Svc->>Sock: CheckinDisplayUpdated
    Sock-->>Kiosk: checkin.display mode sap or lpr

    Phone->>API: GET /checkin/tickets/:token
    API->>Svc: getTicket
    alt Valid
        Svc-->>Phone: plate name phone plateLocked expiresAt
    else Missing used expired
        Svc-->>Phone: 410 with optional plate hint
    end

    Phone->>API: POST /checkin/submit
    API->>Svc: submit
    Svc->>Queue: enqueueFromCheckin
    alt created false
        Svc-->>Phone: 409 already_queued
    else created true
        Svc->>Redis: SET NX checkin:gate:open EX 30
        alt Acquired
            Svc->>Gate: openForVisit
        else Rate limited
            Note over Svc: Still enqueued without second open
        end
        Svc->>Sock: checkin.display submitted then generic
        Svc-->>Phone: entryId plateNumber gateOpened
    end
